{"shortDescription":"Homebuyers are gaining more power, with new listings jumping and demand flatSEATTLE, Sept. 3, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- New listings of U.S. homes for sale rose 2.1% from a week earlier on a seasonally adjusted basis, reaching their highest level in four years. That's according to a new report from Redf…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"i","children":["Homebuyers are gaining more power, with new listings jumping and demand flat"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["SEATTLE, Sept. 3, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- New listings of U.S. homes for sale rose 2.1% from a week earlier on a seasonally adjusted basis, reaching their highest level in four years. That's according to a new ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4766474-1\u0026h=428363172\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.redfin.com%2Fnews%2Fhousing-market-update-new-listings-4-year-high\u0026a=report","linkText":"report"}}," from ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4766474-1\u0026h=2747484899\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.redfin.com%2F\u0026a=Redfin","linkText":"Redfin"}},", the real estate brokerage powered by Rocket."]},{"type":"p","children":["Other key indicators for the housing market for the four weeks ending August 30:"]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["The total number of homes for sale also ticked up. "]},"Active listings rose 0.4% week over week in welcome news for house hunters, who increasingly have more options and negotiating power."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Demand isn't matching the uptick in supply. "]},"Pending home sales were essentially flat (-0.1%) from a week earlier, dipping to their lowest level since February. The disconnect between growing listings and sluggish sales is exacerbating the ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4766474-1\u0026h=87064008\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.redfin.com%2Fnews%2Fbuyers-vs-sellers-july-2026%2F\u0026a=buyer%27s+market","linkText":"buyer's market"}}," being seen in most of the country."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["High housing costs are the biggest hurdle for prospective buyers. "]},"The typical U.S. home-sale price rose 2.2% year over year, while the average weekly mortgage rate was 6.66%, near its highest level in the last year."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["But list prices are coming down. "]},"The median U.S. asking price inched down 0.1% year over year—a tiny dip, but a sign that sellers may be adjusting their expectations as buyers negotiate and push back against high costs."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Some homes are still attracting bidding wars. "]},"Just over one-quarter (25.9%) of U.S. homes that sold went for over their asking price. Move-in ready homes in desirable neighborhoods are selling fast, according to Redfin agents. Plus, some metro areas are hot: Prices are jumping in San Francisco and West Palm Beach as affluent buyers snap up high-end homes, and pending sales are rising in relatively affordable markets like Milwaukee and Cincinnati."]}]},{"type":"p","children":["For Redfin economists' takes on the housing market, please visit Redfin's \"From Our Economists\" page."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Leading indicators"]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":5,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Indicators of homebuying demand and activity"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"col